// TEST-BOOTSTRAP:STUB
// Showcase tests for lumina/web — generated by /test-bootstrap.
// Each slot is named in its header comment.
//
// Dev deps required (already in package.json):
//   @types/bun  — types for `bun:test`
//   fast-check  — property-based testing
